Tags:           wayland notification daemon notify-send
Comments:       ----------
                starting mako:
                $ [ -S /run/user/*/bus ] || dbus-daemon --session --address=unix:path=$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/bus &
                $ mako >/dev/null 2>&1 &

                example sending notification from terminal (mako must be running in background):
                $ tce-load -wi libnotify
                $ notify-send -t 3000 -i /path/to/icon.png "Example title" "example message"
